); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The menu is a Menu in popover form: it opens under its trigger and is open in every state. Tooltips and announcements of the real menu are not modelled.","The strings of the app are copied under the same Locale keys; a filter name binds through value. en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member pressed Saved filters on the Reviews queue. The list is kept in this browser for this Workspace and member; nothing is written to the Workspace and nothing is shared with other members.","The base state is a list of three saved filters, none applied; Variants show the applied one, the empty list, the name form and its refusals, and the member who cannot save.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the strings follow the Workbench language and filter names are literal text the member typed."],"intent":"Show the per-browser saved filters of the Reviews inbox: the Saved filters menu with its list, an active filter, the empty list, the name form for saving and renaming with its three refusals, and the disabled Save current filter.","interactionRules":["Each saved filter is a button that applies it and closes the menu; the applied one is marked with a check and named on the Saved filters button. Rename and delete are separate buttons, named by the filter they act on.","Save current filter opens a name field with Cancel and Save; Rename opens the same field with the current name. A name is trimmed and at most 40 characters; the field says \"Enter a name.\" when it is empty and \"A saved filter already has this name.\" when another filter has it, and with 20 filters saved it says so and asks to delete one first.","Save current filter is disabled when no signed-in member identifies the browser; the menu always says the filters are kept in this browser only."],"references":[{"label":